      "content": "That's a start, but it feels a bit... dense. Like, I can see all the keywords in there, which is good for the filter, but it almost feels like the actual point of my research is getting lost in all the terminology. It reads a little bit like a checklist of academic buzzwords rather than a real person explaining their passion.\n\nCan we try to expand this? I need to explain *how* the digital infrastructure actually changes that perception. Maybe try to weave those terms in more naturally while really digging into the \"how\" and \"why\" of the rural community aspect. Try to make it flow better so it doesn't look like I'm just trying to hit every single keyword from that list.",
